{
  "A panel that slides in from an edge of the page or of a container, over the content or pushing it aside. A finger swipes it in from the edge and back again; Escape, the scrim and the browser's back close it.": "",
  "A drawer over the page": "",
  "Bound with `x-model`, or opened with `open()` and `show(host)` as a bottom sheet is. Over the page it opens in the top layer, modal, with a scrim.": "",
  "Edges, push and swipes": "",
  "Over a frame (`container`), from any edge. `push` moves the frame's content aside (`pushTarget`) and is not modal unless asked. With `edgeSwipe` a finger on a touch screen opens it from the edge; every option is live.": "",
  "Finger and keys": "",
  "The drawer follows the finger; let go past half its size (or flicked), it stays open, else it goes back.": "",
  "It follows; let go past half (or flicked), it closes. A swipe on something inside that scrolls sideways is that thing's.": "",
  "It closes (each an option).": "",
  "The panel is `role=\"dialog\"`, named by its title, else `label`, else \"Side panel\"; `aria-modal` when modal, and what is around it is `inert`.": "",
  "Moves in when it opens modal, back where it was when it closes.": "",
  "`start` is the left edge left to right and the right edge right to left; the slide follows.": "",
  "Its default name and the close button come from `uiLocale.strings` (`drawerLabel`, `close`).": "",
  "The layer. `data-side` (`start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`), `data-mode`, `data-open`, `data-modal`, `data-scrim`, `data-contained`, `data-dragging`.": "",
  "The dialog. `--_size`, and `--_shift-x` / `--_shift-y` while a finger moves it.": "",
  "The element a push drawer moves aside, by `--_mx-push`.": "",
  "Units: the dimmed layer; the surface at each edge (`start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`: its sides towards the content and the room differ) and pushing the content (`push`).": "",
  "The size it opens at, the most of the room it takes, the room around it; the type’s family.": "",
  "Whether it is open. `x-model` binds it two-way.": "",
  "The edge it slides in from. `start` and `end` follow the reading direction; `left` and `right` do not.": "",
  "Over the content, or moving `pushTarget` aside by its size.": "",
  "What `push` moves aside. Without it, `push` works as `over`.": "",
  "Its width (its height from the top or the bottom): pixels or a CSS length; `null` for `drawer.size`. Never more than 85% of the room.": "",
  "A finger swiping in from the edge of the container (or the page) opens it, following the finger.": "",
  "How far from the edge, in pixels, that swipe may start.": "",
  "A finger swiping it back towards its edge closes it.": "",
  "A flick faster than this, in pixels per millisecond, opens or closes it however far it went.": "",
  "`true` over, `false` in push": "",
  "Nothing around it can be used; Tab stays inside.": "",
  "The props every overlay panel shares, as on the [BottomSheet page](/bottomsheet#api).": "",
  "As on a bottom sheet.": "",
  "As on a bottom sheet; a swipe back closes with `reason: 'swipe'`. A swipe from the edge that `onOpening` refuses does not move it.": ""
}
